body, EPDM seals and O-rings, polypropylene piston, and NPT hex brass adapter end connections for easy installation.  Series 15M2 is factory air charged and is not rechargeable.  The sealed chamber prevents the loss of air to the water and ensures long and trouble-free life.  It can be installed in new or existing plumbing systems in concealed locations with a standard pipe tee in any angle. Series 15M2 is ideal for commercial dishwashers, clothes washers, and quick-closing faucets. ASSE and ANSI approved, PDI certified, and IAPMO listed. Maximum Working Pressure: 150psi (10.6 bar).","Type Country":"United States","Type Workset":"Family  : Pipe Accessories : Water_Hammer_Arrestor-WATTS-Threaded-15M2_Series","Type Classification Number":"23.60.30.11.14.11","Type Export Type to IFC":"Default","Type Type IfcGUID":"1J7_YgP4L3_v8IG0At__Ru","Type Material":"Metal-Watts-Copper","Type Max. Working Pressure":" 150psi (10.6 bar)","Type Connection Type":"Male NPT"},"elementId":48160073,"elementCategory":"Pipe Accessories"}},{"name":"PipeInsulation Pipe Insulations <48160074 Generic Isulation - Fiberglass<","mesh":466,"extras":{"uniqueId":"531fe8aa-6445-43fb-9212-4002b526d9b8-02dedd4a","parameters":{"System Classification":"Undefined","System Type":"Undefined","Pipe Size":"1\"ø-1\"ø-1\"ø","Insulation Thickness":"1\"","Export to IFC":"By Type","IfcGUID":"1J7_YgP4L3_v8IG0At_0Jo","Workset":"AR - Exterior","Phase Created":"New Construction","Phase Demolished":"None","Design Option":"Main Model","Type Export Type to IFC":"Default","Type Type IfcGUID":"1J7_YgP4L3_v8IG0Aty1v5","Type Material":"Insulation - Fiberglass","Type Workset":"Pipe Insulation"},"elementId":48160074,"elementCategory":"Pipe Insulations"}},{"name":"Pipe Pipes <48160075 COPPER TYPE K-L-M (ASTM B88)<","mesh":467,"extras":{"uniqueId":"531fe8aa-6445-43fb-9212-4002b526d9b8-02dedd4b","parameters":{"System Classification":"Domestic Cold Water","System Type":"Domestic Cold Water","System Name":"Domestic Cold Water 11","Pi