r_Arrestor-WATTS-Threaded-15M2_Series <48160276 1/2\" 15M2-A<","mesh":576,"extras":{"uniqueId":"531fe8aa-6445-43fb-9212-4002b526d9b8-02dede14","parameters":{"Level":"LEVEL 3","Elevation from Level":"544.203 mm","Size":"1\"ø","Use Annotation Scale":"Yes","Comments":"Wh-01","Workset":"AR - Exterior","Design Option":"Main Model","Export to IFC":"By Type","IfcGUID":"WATER KITCHEN","System Classification":"Domestic Cold Water","System Type":"Domestic Cold Water","System Name":"Domestic Cold Water 11","Loss Method":"3bf616f9-6b98-4a21-80ff-da1120c8f6d6","Pressure Drop":"0.00 psi","Phase Created":"New Construction","Phase Demolished":"None","Overall Size":"1\"ø","Insulation Thickness":"0\"","Type Connection Radius":"0\"","Type Default Elevation":"0.000 mm","Type Tube Small Radius":"11.176 mm","Type Tube Large Radius":"14.224 mm","Type Thread Radius":"10.160 mm","Type Thread Length":"16.002 mm","Type Over All Length":"150.825 mm","Type Flare Distance":"13.462 mm","Type Fillet Radius":"5.080 mm","Type Adapter Radius":"12.446 mm","Type Adapter Length":"39.878 mm","Type Product data url":"https://bimobject.com/watts/product/7137","Type URL":"http://www.watts.com","Type Region":"North America","Type Product Page URL":"http://www.watts.com/pages/_products_details.asp?pid=7137","Type Product Documentation Link":"http://media.wattswater.com/ES-15M2.pdf","Type Ordering Code":"0750140","Type Manufacturer Product Line":"Water Safety & Flow Control","Type Installation Instructions":"http://www.watts.com/pdf/2915049.pdf","Type Cross Fixture Units Supported":"1-11","Type Model":"15M2","Type Manufacturer":"WATTS","Type Description":"Series 15M2 Water Hammer Arrestors are used in commercial and industrial applications to control water pressure shock and prevent water hammer conditions. It consists of a copper body, EPDM seals and O-rings, polypropylene piston, and NPT hex brass adapter end connections for easy installation.  Series 15M2 is factory air charged and is not rechargeable.  The sealed chamber prevents the loss of air to the water and ensures long and trouble-free life.  It can be installed in new or existing plumbing systems in concealed locations with a standard pipe tee in any angle. Series 15M2 is ideal for commercial dishwashers, clothes washers, and quick-closing faucets. ASSE and ANSI approved, PDI certified, and IAPMO listed. Maximum Working Pressure: 150psi (10.6 bar).","Type Country":"United States","Type Workset":"Family  : Pipe Accessories : Water_Hammer_Arrestor-WATTS-Threaded-15M2_Series","Type Classification Number":"23.60.30.11.14.11","Type Export Type to IFC":"Default","Type Type IfcGUID":"1J7_YgP4L3_v8IG0At__Ru","Type Material":"Metal-Watts-Copper","Type Max. Working Pressure":" 150psi (10.6 bar)","Type Connection Type":"Male NPT"},"elementId":48160276,"elementCategory":"Pipe Accessories"}},{"name":"FamilyInstance Pipe Fittings M_Tee - Welded - Generic <48160279 M_TEE - WELDED - GENERIC<","mesh":577,"extras":{"uniqueId":"531fe8aa-6445-43fb-9212-4002b526d9b8-02dede17","parameters":{"Center to End Label":"1\"","Fitting Outside Radius":"0\"","Angle 1":"90.00°","Level":"LEVEL 3","Elevation from Level":"508.000 mm","Tick Size":"0\"","Nominal Radius":"0\"","Nominal Diameter":"1\"","Fitting Outside Diameter":"1\"","Center to End":"1\"","Angle":"90.00°","Size":"1\"ø-1\"ø-1\"ø","Use Annotation Scale":"Yes","Comments":"Tt-01","Workset":"AR - Exterior","Design Option":"Main Model","Export to IFC":"By Type","IfcGUID":"WATER KITCHEN","System Classification":"Domestic Hot Water","System Type":"Domestic Hot Water","System Name":"Domestic Hot Water 13","Loss Method":"3bf616f9-6b98-4a21-80ff-da1120c8f6d6","Phase Created":"New Construction","Phase Demolished":"None","PANEL ASSIGNMENT":"Kitchen","Overall Size":"3\"ø-3\"ø-3\"ø","Insulation Thickness":"1\"","Insulation Type":"Generic Isulation - Fiberglass","Type Lookup Table Name":"M_Tee - Welded - Generic","Type Default Elevation":"0.000 mm","Type Workset":"Family  : Pipe Fittings : M_Tee -