 pressure shock and prevent water hammer conditions. It consists of a copper body, EPDM seals and O-rings, polypropylene piston, and NPT hex brass adapter end connections for easy installation.  Series 15M2 is factory air charged and is not rechargeable.  The sealed chamber prevents the loss of air to the water and ensures long and trouble-free life.  It can be installed in new or existing plumbing systems in concealed locations with a standard pipe tee in any angle. Series 15M2 is ideal for commercial dishwashers, clothes washers, and quick-closing faucets. ASSE and ANSI approved, PDI certified, and IAPMO listed. Maximum Working Pressure: 150psi (10.6 bar).","Type Country":"United States","Type Workset":"Family  : Pipe Accessories : Water_Hammer_Arrestor-WATTS-Threaded-15M2_Series","Type Classification Number":"23.60.30.11.14.11","Type Export Type to IFC":"Default","Type Type IfcGUID":"1J7_YgP4L3_v8IG0At__Ru","Type Material":"Metal-Watts-Copper","Type Max. Working Pressure":" 150psi (10.6 bar)","Type Connection Type":"Male NPT"},"elementId":48160319,"elementCategory":"Pipe Accessories"}},{"name":"FamilyInstance Pipe Fittings M_Elbow - Generic <48160320 M_ELBOW - GENERIC<","mesh":592,"extras":{"uniqueId":"531fe8aa-6445-43fb-9212-4002b526d9b8-02dede40","parameters":{"Fitting Outside Radius":"0\"","Center Radius":"1\"","Level":"LEVEL 3","Elevation from Level":"394.010 mm","Tick Size":"0\"","Nominal Radius":"0\"","Nominal Diameter":"1\"","Fitting Outside Diameter":"1\"","Center to End":"1\"","Angle":"90.00°","Size":"1\"ø-1\"ø","Use Annotation Scale":"Yes","Workset":"AR - Exterior","Design Option":"Main Model","Export to IFC":"By Type","System Classification":"Domestic Hot Water","System Type":"Domestic Hot Water","System Name":"Domestic Hot Water 13","Loss Method":"3bf616f9-6b98-4a21-80ff-da1120c8f6d6","Phase Created":"New Construction","Phase Demolished":"None","Overall Size":"3\"ø-3\"ø","Insulation Thickness":"1\"","Insulation Type":"Generic Isulation - Fiberglass","