are Distance":"13.462 mm","Type Fillet Radius":"5.080 mm","Type Adapter Radius":"12.446 mm","Type Adapter Length":"39.878 mm","Type Product data url":"https://bimobject.com/watts/product/7137","Type URL":"http://www.watts.com","Type Region":"North America","Type Product Page URL":"http://www.watts.com/pages/_products_details.asp?pid=7137","Type Product Documentation Link":"http://media.wattswater.com/ES-15M2.pdf","Type Ordering Code":"0750140","Type Manufacturer Product Line":"Water Safety & Flow Control","Type Installation Instructions":"http://www.watts.com/pdf/2915049.pdf","Type Cross Fixture Units Supported":"1-11","Type Model":"15M2","Type Manufacturer":"WATTS","Type Description":"Series 15M2 Water Hammer Arrestors are used in commercial and industrial applications to control water pressure shock and prevent water hammer conditions. It consists of a copper body, EPDM seals and O-rings, polypropylene piston, and NPT hex brass adapter end connections for easy installation.  Series 15M2 is factory air charged and is not rechargeable.  The sealed chamber prevents the loss of air to the water and ensures long and trouble-free life.  It can be installed in new or existing plumbing systems in concealed locations with a standard pipe tee in any angle. Series 15M2 is ideal for commercial dishwashers, clothes washers, and quick-closing faucets. ASSE and ANSI approved, PDI certified, and IAPMO listed. Maximum Working Pressure: 150psi (10.6 bar).","Type Country":"United States","Type Workset":"Family  : Pipe Accessories : Water_Hammer_Arrestor-WATTS-Threaded-15M2_Series","Type Classification Number":"23.60.30.11.14.11","Type Export Type to IFC":"Default","Type Type IfcGUID":"1J7_YgP4L3_v8IG0At__Ru","Type Material":"Metal-Watts-Copper","Type Max. Working Pressure":" 150psi (10.6 bar)","Type Connection Type":"Male NPT"},"elementId":48160523,"elementCategory":"Pipe Accessories"}},{"name":"PipeInsulation Pipe Insulations <48160524 Generic Isulation - Fiberglass<","mesh":717,"e