d chamber prevents the loss of air to the water and ensures long and trouble-free life.  It can be installed in new or existing plumbing systems in concealed locations with a standard pipe tee in any angle. Series 15M2 is ideal for commercial dishwashers, clothes washers, and quick-closing faucets. ASSE and ANSI approved, PDI certified, and IAPMO listed. Maximum Working Pressure: 150psi (10.6 bar).","Type Country":"United States","Type Workset":"Family  : Pipe Accessories : Water_Hammer_Arrestor-WATTS-Threaded-15M2_Series","Type Classification Number":"23.60.30.11.14.11","Type Export Type to IFC":"Default","Type Type IfcGUID":"1J7_YgP4L3_v8IG0At__Ru","Type Material":"Metal-Watts-Copper","Type Max. Working Pressure":" 150psi (10.6 bar)","Type Connection Type":"Male NPT"},"elementId":48562094,"elementCategory":"Pipe Accessories"}},{"name":"PipeInsulation Pipe Insulations <48562095 Generic Isulation - Fiberglass<","mesh":1322,"extras":{"uniqueId":"a44799b9-3ab8-4452-a4e7-e08f4a06c316-02e4ffaf","parameters":{"System Classification":"Domestic Hot Water","System Type":"Domestic Hot Water","System Name":"Domestic Hot Water 2","Pipe Size":"1\"ø-1\"ø-1\"ø","Insulation Thickness":"1\"","Export to IFC":"By Type","IfcGUID":"2aHvcvEhX4KgJdu8z8uZov","Workset":"AR - Exterior","Phase Created":"New Construction","Phase Demolished":"None","Design Option":"Main Model","Type Export Type to IFC":"Default","Type Type IfcGUID":"1J7_YgP4L3_v8IG0Aty1v5","Type Material":"Insulation - Fiberglass","Type Workset":"Pipe Insulation"},"elementId":48562095,"elementCategory":"Pipe Insulations"}},{"name":"PipeInsulation Pipe Insulations <48562096 Generic Isulation - Fiberglass<","mesh":1323,"extras":{"uniqueId":"a44799b9-3ab8-4452-a4e7-e08f4a06c316-02e4ffb0","parameters":{"System Classification":"Domestic Hot Water","System Type":"Domestic Hot Water","System Name":"Domestic Hot Water 2","Pipe Size":"1\"ø","Volume":"0.01 CF","Insulation Thickness":"1\"","Area":"0 SF","Export to IFC":"By Type","IfcGUID